      "id": "18133230793679841",
      "caption": "A special thank you to St. Petersburg Pediatrics, our Presenting Sponsor! \ud83d\ude4f\ud83c\udffb\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Thank you for supporting FloridaRAMA and helping make this event possible! \ud83d\udc4f! \ud83c\udf83\u2728 \n\n\ud83c\udf83\ud83e\ude7a St. Petersburg Pediatrics is joining the Halloween fun at FloridaRAMA! \ud83d\udc7b\u2728\n\n\ud83c\udf83\ud83d\udc7b Get your tickets to the Halloween Toddler Rave at\ud83c\udf9f\ufe0f www.FloridaRAMA.art \ud83e\udea9\u2728 \n\nGet ready for a spooktacular experience filled with immersive art, exciting displays, and family-friendly Halloween fun! Bring the little ones and enjoy a day of creativity, adventure, and unforgettable memories.\n\n\ud83d\udcc5 October 24th | 10:00 AM \u2013 12:00 PM\n\ud83d\udccd 2606 Fairfield Ave S Bldg 5, St. Petersburg, FL 33712\n\nBring the family and celebrate Halloween with us! \ud83e\udde1\ud83d\udda4\n\n#StPetersburgPediatrics #Floridarama #HalloweenSpecial #StPetersburgFlorida #familyfun",
